      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pul_hearts",
      "narration": "Two hearts pump blood to the gills, and a third sends it to the rest of the body.",
      "on_screen_text": "Three hearts",
      "highlight_words": [
        "Three"
      ],
      "sfx": "pop",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pul_blue",
      "narration": "Its blood is blue because it carries oxygen with copper, instead of the iron we use.",
      "on_screen_text": "Copper-blue blood",
      "highlight_words": [
        "blue"
      ],
      "sfx": "bubbles",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pul_swim",
      "narration": "And when it swims, its main heart stops. That's why it prefers to crawl along the bottom.",
      "on_screen_text": "Swimming tires it out",
      "highlight_words": [
        "tires"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pul_brain",
      "narration": "It has about five hundred million neurons, and two thirds of them are in its arms: each arm almost thinks for itself.",
      "on_screen_text": "Arms that think",
      "highlight_words": [
        "think"
      ],
      "sfx": "riser",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pul_camo",
      "narration": "With color cells in its skin, it changes color and texture in a fraction of a second.",
      "on_screen_text": "Instant camouflage",
      "highlight_words": [
        "Instant"
      ],
      "sfx": "whoosh",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pul_squeeze",
      "narration": "It has no bones: the only hard part is its beak, so it can squeeze through any gap bigger than that.",
      "on_screen_text": "Through any gap",
      "highlight_words": [
        "gap"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pul_ink",
      "narration": "And if something attacks it, it squirts a cloud of ink and jets away.",
      "on_screen_text": "A cloud of ink",
      "highlight_words": [
        "ink"
      ],
      "sfx": "whoosh",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "surprise",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "pul_taste",
      "narration": "The weirdest part: its suckers can taste whatever they touch.",
