  "description": "The octopus has three hearts (two for the gills and one for the body), blue blood from copper-based hemocyanin, and its main heart stops while it swims. About two thirds of its ~500 million neurons are in its arms, it changes color in a fraction of a second, squeezes through any gap bigger than its beak, squirts ink and can taste with its suckers. Original 3D animation.",
